# Readable names for the game's obfuscated ones (xref src and dump apply them; nothing from the game is here).
#   Type = Name                 a type (a dot in Name also sets a top-level type's namespace)
#   Type::member = Name         every field, method, property and event of that name in that type (the
#                               obfuscator reuses names across types, so a name is only ever mapped per type)
#   ... = Name?                 a guess: it comes out as Name_maybe
# Type is a full name (Nested types: Outer/Inner) or a plain name if that's unique. Add what each session works out.

